[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0010","text":"（今天学的东西……\n　还有做不到的地方……怎么办……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0020","text":"（好厉害……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0030","text":"果、果然\n甜花也，要练……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0040","text":"哇……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0050","text":"没事吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0060","text":"嗯、嗯……没事的……\n对不起……打扰到你了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0070","text":"没有受伤就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0080","text":"啊，那个……\n那个，绯田小姐……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0090","text":"什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0100","text":"那个……绯田小姐……\n一直在练习……好厉害……呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0110","text":"……厉害？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0120","text":"甜、甜花也……想向绯田小姐学习，\n试着努力一下……这么想过，但是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0130","text":"还是会说出“好想回家啊”这种……泄气话……\n绯田小姐……不会有这种想法……吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0140","text":"……没有吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021500_02_0150","text":"……不过，如果是在练习室或者舞台上的话\n说不定会想回去"}]
